# Landing page type

The landing page uses Schibsted Grotesk in sentence case.

- Do not use `font-mono`, `uppercase`, or wide tracked kickers.
- Do not write labels in all caps. Write "The footage", not "THE FOOTAGE".
- Keep real names as they are spelled. The token is MILE. Acronyms such as GPS, IMU, and SHA-256 stay.
- Buttons, nav, and the footer use the same sentence case. "View Demo", not "VIEW DEMO".
